tonight we honor those women and men  whose careers have transformed our  industry we honor those who set new  standards of excellence we honor those  who have touched us with their talents  which is why we honor my friends Kathy  Kennedy and Frank Marshall  individually and together  there's ranks on a very short list of  the greatest careers in Hollywood  history and you can tell that by the  fact that we know who they are just like  all of the legends simply by their first  names the Stevens the Clint's Cicely  Cathy and Frank no last name required in  this town it's just an incredible body  of work that they both have so just to  put it in personal perspective I did the  Jason Bourne movies with Frank and  that's probably like the pinnacle of my  career I don't think they make Frank's  top 10 and as for Cathy at this point  probably not even her top 20 so but I  think the most remarkable thing about  them and admirable is the way they treat  everyone who works with them and it  comes from the fact that they love what  they do so much and because of that they  love and respect all who were involved  with them on every project they're  always so supportive of all their people  and I am proud to be one of their people  not just because they've created these  incredible careers but because they are  two of the best human beings I've ever  met so tonight it is a privilege to be  here with them as they receive yet one  more well-deserved accolade
 

